WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.017 --> 00:00:01.451
- You can like maybe
trick people into thinking

00:00:01.451 --> 00:00:03.509
you're super healthy and
drinking water all the time,

00:00:03.509 --> 00:00:06.969
but it's just like (bleeping) coffee.

00:00:06.969 --> 00:00:10.136
(smooth, jazzy music)

00:00:18.314 --> 00:00:21.022
- Wow, this literally just
looks like a bottle of water.

00:00:21.022 --> 00:00:22.207
- I think if this were a drink you ordered

00:00:22.207 --> 00:00:23.910
on an airplane, you'd be
really happy to get it

00:00:23.910 --> 00:00:25.599
'cause it's huge and
it looks like alcohol.

00:00:25.599 --> 00:00:27.495
- Oh, look it, how British.

00:00:27.495 --> 00:00:29.127
The date is written the other way.

00:00:29.127 --> 00:00:32.194
I was like, "19/1? This is
some future (bleeping)."

00:00:32.194 --> 00:00:33.883
- It smells like when I make coffee

00:00:33.883 --> 00:00:36.819
at home and then leave
the pot to sit there.

00:00:36.819 --> 00:00:38.835
Maybe a little bit like warm tequila.

00:00:38.835 --> 00:00:40.123
- It smells like coffee.

00:00:40.123 --> 00:00:42.115
Like it smells like espresso beans.

00:00:42.115 --> 00:00:44.948
- Hopefully it tastes like coffee.

00:00:47.539 --> 00:00:49.272
- It weirdly kind of tastes like vaguely

00:00:49.272 --> 00:00:50.689
of alcohol to me.

00:00:53.434 --> 00:00:55.184
- Something is wrong.

00:00:56.833 --> 00:00:59.541
- Yeah, something's wrong.

00:00:59.541 --> 00:01:02.624
- It tastes primarily like water that

00:01:03.643 --> 00:01:05.793
once touched a coffee bean.

00:01:05.793 --> 00:01:07.169
- I actually like it.

00:01:07.169 --> 00:01:08.194
I really do.

00:01:08.194 --> 00:01:09.932
And I feel more awake.
(chuckling)

00:01:09.932 --> 00:01:12.091
- Oh, it's like a little bit nice,

00:01:12.091 --> 00:01:14.653
'cause I like water so much. (laughing)

00:01:14.653 --> 00:01:17.986
- But why wouldn't you just drink water?

00:01:19.413 --> 00:01:21.281
- That's coffee flavored water.

00:01:21.281 --> 00:01:23.208
- It's just weird that it looks so clear

00:01:23.208 --> 00:01:26.160
'cause I really am
expecting water, you know.

00:01:26.160 --> 00:01:28.858
- Maybe we should ice it
and try and put milk in it

00:01:28.858 --> 00:01:31.313
and see if it tastes like what coffee is.

00:01:31.313 --> 00:01:33.049
Has anyone done that yet?

00:01:33.049 --> 00:01:36.033
- That looks kind of cool, actually.

00:01:36.033 --> 00:01:37.665
Does not make it taste any different.

00:01:37.665 --> 00:01:39.633
- I'm a person that
really likes black coffee

00:01:39.633 --> 00:01:40.931
without any sugar and stuff

00:01:40.931 --> 00:01:43.737
so this to me is like, this is dope.

00:01:43.737 --> 00:01:45.165
- If it works for you, man, go for it.

00:01:45.165 --> 00:01:46.602
Clear coffee, I don't know.

00:01:46.602 --> 00:01:48.584
It's not for me, I'm gonna
stick with my normal coffee.

00:01:48.584 --> 00:01:51.417
- I do know a lot of people who refuse to

00:01:51.417 --> 00:01:53.778
drink coffee without a straw
because they're worried

00:01:53.778 --> 00:01:55.040
of staining their teeth.

00:01:55.040 --> 00:01:58.058
That's probably who it's
for, which is stupid.

00:01:58.058 --> 00:02:02.922
Just live your (bleeping) life, right?

00:02:02.922 --> 00:02:06.089
(smooth jazzy music)

